1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,119
查一个问题，Claude 翻了一大堆文件，
Ask one question and Claude reads a pile of files,

2
00:00:02,139 --> 00:00:04,220
主对话的上下文就这么被占满了。
and your main context fills up.

3
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:05,431
子代理就是解法：
Subagents are the fix:

4
00:00:05,451 --> 00:00:07,549
它在自己的上下文窗口里干活，
they work in their own context window

5
00:00:07,569 --> 00:00:09,160
只把摘要交回来。
and hand back only a summary.

6
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:11,866
比如问一句：这个应用在哪处理退款？
Ask where the app handles refunds,

7
00:00:11,886 --> 00:00:14,670
Claude 会派探索型子代理去翻代码。
and Claude sends an Explore subagent to dig through the code.

8
00:00:14,690 --> 00:00:16,527
翻的过程留在子代理那边，
The digging stays with the subagent.

9
00:00:16,547 --> 00:00:18,100
主对话里只剩结论。
Your main conversation gets just the conclusion.

10
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:19,664
官方示意里，子代理读了
In Anthropic's illustration, the subagent

11
00:00:19,684 --> 00:00:22,040
六千多 token，只回你四百多。
reads over 6,000 tokens and sends back only about 400.

12
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:23,380
自带几个子代理：
Claude Code ships with built-in subagents:

13
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:25,056
Explore 只读搜代码，
Explore searches code read-only,

14
00:00:25,076 --> 00:00:26,870
Plan 做计划调研。
Plan researches in plan mode.

15
00:00:26,890 --> 00:00:28,972
想自己做一个？最省事的办法，
Want your own? The easy way is to ask Claude:

16
00:00:28,992 --> 00:00:30,770
是直接让 Claude 来建。
build me a subagent.

17
00:00:30,790 --> 00:00:32,973
官方课演示的 /agents 创建向导，
The /agents creation wizard shown in the course has been

18
00:00:32,993 --> 00:00:35,050
新版本已经删了，别照着找。
removed in newer versions, so don't go looking for it.

19
00:00:35,070 --> 00:00:38,125
描述写得好，Claude 才知道什么时候该
A good description tells Claude when to call it,

20
00:00:38,145 --> 00:00:41,160
叫它；用 @ 点名，则一定会派它。
and an @ mention guarantees it runs.

21
00:00:41,180 --> 00:00:43,522
子代理就是带 YAML 头的 Markdown
A subagent is a Markdown file with YAML frontmatter,

22
00:00:43,542 --> 00:00:46,150
文件，必填只有两个：名字和描述。
and only the name and description are required.

23
00:00:46,170 --> 00:00:47,335
加一行 memory，
Add one memory line

24
00:00:47,355 --> 00:00:50,070
它就能跨对话记住东西，越用越熟。
and it can remember things across conversations.

25
00:00:50,090 --> 00:00:52,667
还能预载技能：写进 skills 字段，
You can also preload skills: list them in the skills field,

26
00:00:52,687 --> 00:00:55,380
整份技能都会塞进它的上下文。
and the whole skill is injected into its context.

27
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:57,275
不过子代理自己也花用量，
Subagents spend usage of their own, so they aren't free.

28
00:00:57,295 --> 00:01:00,530
别当成免费的。脏活外包，只收结论。
Outsource the heavy lifting; take only the conclusion.
